OL,3,ABurnham says 'unthinkable' for UK to   
OL,4,Arejoin EU without a referendum         
OL,6,FAndy Burnham says it's "unthinkable"   
OL,7,Fthat the UK would rejoin the EU without
OL,8,Fa referendum - he's currently facing   
OL,9,Fquestions from his MPs about his new   
OL,10,FUK-EU deal                             
OL,12,FHe says "too many bridges were burned  
OL,13,Fwith Europe" during the first Brexit   
OL,14,Fdeal, and Britain should consider a    
OL,15,F"range of options" going forward       
OL,17,FThe new deal includes a youth mobility 
OL,18,Fscheme, scrapping most checks on       
OL,19,FBritish food exports, and the linking  
OL,20,Fof EU and UK emissions trading systems 
OL,21,F- see a recap here                     
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
