OL,3,ACan AI spot breast cancer earlier? NHS 
OL,4,Alaunches world's largest trial to find 
OL,5,Aout                                    
OL,7,FWomen aged 50 to 71 are invited for    
OL,8,Froutine breast screening every three   
OL,9,Fyears in the UK, and more than two     
OL,10,Fmillion attend annually.               
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
