OL,3,APip assessments need 'fundamental      
OL,4,Aoverhaul', report to say               
OL,6,FA review into the personal independence
OL,7,Fpayment (Pip) will call for a          
OL,8,F"fundamental overhaul" of the          
OL,9,Fassessment process to "better recognise
OL,10,Fpeople's varying costs and needs", the 
OL,11,Fdisability minister has said.          
OL,13,FSir Stephen Timms has been looking into
OL,14,Fdisability benefits in England and     
OL,15,FWales for the past year and found the  
OL,16,Fset up was "no longer fit for purpose".
OL,18,FWriting in the Times, he said his      
OL,19,Freview, to be published on Tuesday,    
OL,20,Fwould recommend people with the most   
OL,21,Fsevere conditions have a "fast track"  
OL,22,Fprocess which is "less burdensome".    
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
