OL,4,AFrance': On the streets with the French
OL,5,Aultra left                             
OL,7,FPresident Emmanuel Macron has publicly 
OL,8,Fblamed riots on "delinquents" and      
OL,9,F"ultra-left groups" whose aim, he says,
OL,10,Fis to bring down the French Republic.  
OL,12,FThat's quite a claim ` and one that    
OL,13,Fneeds examining.                       
